      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "的正弦函数和余弦函数的导函数公式：",
        "$\\operatorname{tg}' x=\\left(\\frac{\\sin x}{\\cos x}\\right)'=\\frac{(\\sin x)'\\cos x-(\\cos x)'\\sin x}{\\cos^2x}↵=\\frac{\\cos^2x+\\sin^2x}{\\cos^2x}=\\frac{1}{\\cos^2x}$，",
        "$\\operatorname{ctg}' x=\\left(\\frac{\\cos x}{\\sin x}\\right)'=\\frac{(\\cos x)'\\sin x-(\\sin x)'\\cos x}{\\sin^2x}↵=\\frac{-\\sin^2x-\\cos^2x}{\\sin^2x}=-\\frac{1}{\\sin^2x}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "例　求正弦曲线在横坐标 $x_1=0$，$x_2=\\frac{\\pi}{2}$，$x_3=\\pi$ 三点上",
        "的切线."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "正如你们所知道的（第52小节），函数 $f$ 的图象在点",
        "$(x_0,y_0)$（这里 $y_0=f(x_0)$）的切线方程具有下面的形式："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$y-y_0=f'(x_0)(x-x_0)$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "在这种情况下，$f(x)=\\sin x$. 为了解题，应当求出正弦函数在",
        "点 $0$、$\\frac{\\pi}{2}$ 和 $\\pi$ 处的导函数值. 正弦函数的导函数等于余弦函",
        "数：$f'(0)=\\cos0=1$. 其次，我们求出"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$f'\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\right)=\\cos\\frac{\\pi}{2}=0$ 和 $f'(\\pi)=\\cos\\pi=-1$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "因此："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "1) 在横坐标 $x_1=0$ 这一点，切线方程有 $y-0=1\\cdot(x-0)$",
        "的形式，也就是 $y=x$. 我们看到，在点 $(0,0)$ 处，正弦曲线",
        "的切线是第一象限和第三象限的平分线（图 2）."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
